        "The fixture starts with a live keyed view missing one event and containing an old revision. A bounded authoritative correction replaces the state and is replayed without changing it. It demonstrates sequential reconciliation and idempotence only; production correctness still requires sink transactions, source completeness and agreed consumer correction semantics."
